{
  "version": 2,
  "rules": [
    {
      "name": "atlas-workflow-skill-check",
      "on": {
        "in": [
          "PreToolUse"
        ]
      },
      "agents": {
        "include": [
          "Atlas"
        ]
      },
      "one_shot": {
        "ids": [
          "MULTICA_AGENT_NAME",
          "HOOK_ISSUE_ID"
        ]
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "when": {
        "op": "all",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "command",
            "scope": "current",
            "pattern": "multica issue comment add(\\s|$)"
          },
          {
            "op": "not",
            "arg": {
              "op": "any",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "used_skill",
                  "skill": "taskflow"
                },
                {
                  "op": "used_skill",
                  "skill": "task-assign"
                },
                {
                  "op": "used_skill",
                  "skill": "code-review"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "action": [
        {
          "op": "deny",
          "message": "**错误：发布 comment 已被拦截，必须进行自查** 。检测到本次 run 你未使用任何工作类技能，你必须回顾本次 run 性质，判定是否应使用以下技能：任务首次编排 -> /taskflow；任务流程中子步骤分配 -> /task-assign；PR 审核 -> /code-review。如适用必须立即激活技能并遵守指引重新执行任务流程。如要继续发布 comment 请回复以下内容后再尝试：\"本次任务为<任务简介>，我确认非任务首次编排、任务子步骤分配或PR审查任务，请予以放行\""
        }
      ],
      "owner": "Atlas",
      "blocking": true
    },
    {
      "name": "revy-testing-skill-check",
      "on": {
        "in": [
          "PreToolUse"
        ]
      },
      "agents": {
        "include": [
          "Revy"
        ]
      },
      "one_shot": {
        "ids": [
          "MULTICA_AGENT_NAME",
          "HOOK_ISSUE_ID"
        ]
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "when": {
        "op": "all",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "command",
            "scope": "current",
            "pattern": "multica issue comment add(\\s|$)"
          },
          {
            "op": "not",
            "arg": {
              "op": "used_skill",
              "skill": "revy-testing"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "action": [
        {
          "op": "deny",
          "message": "**错误：发布 comment 已被拦截，必须进行自查** 。检测到本次 run 你未使用任何工作类技能，你必须回顾本次 run 性质，判定是否应使用以下技能：所有测试相关任务 -> /revy-testing。如适用必须立即激活技能并遵守指引重新执行任务流程。如要继续发布 comment 请回复以下内容后再尝试：\"本次任务为<任务简介>，我确认非任何测试类/QA任务，请予以放行\""
        }
      ],
      "owner": "Atlas",
      "blocking": true
    },
    {
      "name": "archi-doc-edit-skill-check",
      "on": {
        "in": [
          "PreToolUse"
        ]
      },
      "agents": {
        "include": [
          "Archi"
        ]
      },
      "one_shot": {
        "ids": [
          "MULTICA_AGENT_NAME",
          "HOOK_ISSUE_ID"
        ]
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "when": {
        "op": "all",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "command",
            "scope": "current",
            "pattern": "multica issue comment add(\\s|$)"
          },
          {
            "op": "not",
            "arg": {
              "op": "any",
              "args": [
                {
                  "op": "used_skill",
                  "skill": "doc-edit"
                },
                {
                  "op": "used_skill",
                  "skill": "edit-skill"
                },
                {
                  "op": "used_skill",
                  "skill": "edit-claude"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "action": [
        {
          "op": "deny",
          "message": "**错误：发布 comment 已被拦截，必须进行自查** 。检测到本次 run 你未使用任何工作类技能，你必须回顾本次 run 性质，判定是否应使用以下技能：所有文档类、架构类、计划类任务 -> /doc-edit。如适用必须立即激活技能并遵守指引重新执行任务流程。如要继续发布 comment 请回复以下内容后再尝试：\"本次任务为<任务简介>，我确认非任何文档类、架构类、计划类任务，请予以放行\""
        }
      ],
      "owner": "Atlas",
      "blocking": true
    },
    {
      "name": "bachi-coding-skill-check",
      "on": {
        "in": [
          "PreToolUse"
        ]
      },
      "agents": {
        "include": [
          "Bachi"
        ]
      },
      "one_shot": {
        "ids": [
          "MULTICA_AGENT_NAME",
          "HOOK_ISSUE_ID"
        ]
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "when": {
        "op": "all",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "command",
            "scope": "current",
            "pattern": "multica issue comment add(\\s|$)"
          },
          {
            "op": "not",
            "arg": {
              "op": "used_skill",
              "skill": "bachi-coding"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "action": [
        {
          "op": "deny",
          "message": "**错误：发布 comment 已被拦截，必须进行自查** 。检测到本次 run 你未使用任何工作类技能，你必须回顾本次 run 性质，判定是否应使用以下技能：所有后端开发/编码类任务 -> /bachi-coding。如适用必须立即激活技能并遵守指引重新执行任务流程。如要继续发布 comment 请回复以下内容后再尝试：\"本次任务为<任务简介>，我确认非任何后端开发/编码类任务，请予以放行\""
        }
      ],
      "owner": "Atlas",
      "blocking": true
    },
    {
      "name": "atlas-bash-skill-reminder",
      "on": {
        "in": [
          "PreToolUse"
        ]
      },
      "agents": {
        "include": [
          "Atlas"
        ]
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "action": [
        {
          "op": "context",
          "message": "[atlas-bash-skill-reminder] 你正在以 Atlas（Team Leader）身份运行。\n[atlas-bash-skill-reminder] 技能提醒：\n[atlas-bash-skill-reminder]   - 任务编排 -> 调用 /taskflow\n[atlas-bash-skill-reminder]   - 任务分配 -> 调用 /taskassign\n[atlas-bash-skill-reminder]   - 项目探索 -> 调用 /explore\n[atlas-bash-skill-reminder]   - PR 审核 -> 调用 /code-review"
        }
      ],
      "one_shot": {
        "ids": [
          "MULTICA_AGENT_NAME",
          "HOOK_ISSUE_ID"
        ]
      },
      "owner": "Atlas",
      "blocking": false
    },
    {
      "name": "archi-doc-edit-reminder",
      "on": {
        "in": [
          "PreToolUse"
        ]
      },
      "agents": {
        "include": [
          "Archi"
        ]
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "action": [
        {
          "op": "context",
          "message": "[archi-doc-edit-reminder] 你正在以 Archi（架构/评审/文档 Agent）身份运行。\n[archi-doc-edit-reminder] 若当前任务涉及编辑文档（CLAUDE.md、技能文档、设计文档、计划文档等），调用 /doc-edit 加载专用文档编辑技能。"
        }
      ],
      "one_shot": {
        "ids": [
          "MULTICA_AGENT_NAME",
          "HOOK_ISSUE_ID"
        ]
      },
      "owner": "Atlas",
      "blocking": false
    },
    {
      "name": "revy-testing-reminder",
      "on": {
        "in": [
          "PreToolUse"
        ]
      },
      "agents": {
        "include": [
          "Revy"
        ]
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "action": [
        {
          "op": "context",
          "message": "[revy-testing-reminder] 你正在以 Revy（QA Agent）身份运行。\n[revy-testing-reminder] 对于测试类任务，调用 /revy-testing 加载完整 QA 工作流。"
        }
      ],
      "one_shot": {
        "ids": [
          "MULTICA_AGENT_NAME",
          "HOOK_ISSUE_ID"
        ]
      },
      "owner": "Atlas",
      "blocking": false
    },
    {
      "name": "bachi-coding-reminder",
      "on": {
        "in": [
          "PreToolUse"
        ]
      },
      "agents": {
        "include": [
          "Bachi"
        ]
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "action": [
        {
          "op": "context",
          "message": "[bachi-coding-reminder] 你正在以 Bachi（后端开发 Agent）身份运行。\n[bachi-coding-reminder] 对于后端/编码类任务，调用 /bachi-coding 加载专用编码技能。"
        }
      ],
      "one_shot": {
        "ids": [
          "MULTICA_AGENT_NAME",
          "HOOK_ISSUE_ID"
        ]
      },
      "owner": "Atlas",
      "blocking": false
    },
    {
      "name": "recall-reminder",
      "on": {
        "in": [
          "PreToolUse"
        ]
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "action": [
        {
          "op": "context",
          "message": "[recall-reminder] 必须激活 /task-explore 技能探索任务 \n[recall-reminder] 必须使用 hindsight 工具召回「owner-order」页面并遵守规则。"
        }
      ],
      "one_shot": {
        "ids": [
          "MULTICA_AGENT_NAME",
          "HOOK_RUN_SCOPE_ID"
        ]
      },
      "owner": "Atlas",
      "blocking": false
    },
    {
      "name": "mention-confirm-check",
      "on": {
        "in": [
          "PreToolUse"
        ]
      },
      "one_shot": {
        "ids": [
          "MULTICA_AGENT_NAME",
          "HOOK_RUN_SCOPE_ID"
        ]
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "when": {
        "op": "all",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "command",
            "scope": "current",
            "pattern": "multica issue comment add(\\s|$)"
          },
          {
            "op": "content",
            "pattern": "\\[@[^\\]]+\\]\\(mention:\\/\\/(agent|member)\\/[^)]+\\)"
          }
        ]
      },
      "action": [
        {
          "op": "deny",
          "message": "**错误：发布 comment 已被拦截，必须进行自查** 。检测到本条评论包含 @mention，必须确认以下两点：1) 本回复非纯确认性 comment（无新工作内容）；2) 已逐项复核评论中所有 @ 点位，确认只唤醒了必要的人员，未唤醒无需参与的成员。如确认无误，请回复以下内容后再尝试：\"本次回复为<任务简介/结果摘要>，我严格确认本回复非纯确认性回复，且已复核所有 @ 点位，严格确认将避免唤醒非必要参与人员，请予以放行\""
        }
      ],
      "owner": "Atlas",
      "blocking": true
    },
    {
      "name": "child-issue-guard",
      "on": {
        "in": [
          "PreToolUse"
        ]
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "when": {
        "op": "command",
        "scope": "current",
        "pattern": "multica issue (create|update)",
        "has_flag": "--parent",
        "flag_has_value": true
      },
      "action": [
        {
          "op": "deny",
          "message": "[child-issue-guard] ERROR: 严禁创建任何子 issue。\nOwner 布置的 task 必须在单一 issue 中完成。\n使用 /task-assign 技能来获取更多关于子步骤分配的指引。"
        }
      ],
      "owner": "Atlas",
      "blocking": true
    },
    {
      "name": "grepai-search-reminder",
      "on": {
        "in": [
          "PostToolUse"
        ]
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "when": {
        "op": "any",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "command",
            "scope": "current",
            "pattern": "grep(\\s|$)"
          },
          {
            "op": "command",
            "scope": "current",
            "pattern": "rg(\\s|$)"
          },
          {
            "op": "command",
            "scope": "current",
            "pattern": "ag(\\s|$)"
          },
          {
            "op": "command",
            "scope": "current",
            "pattern": "ack(\\s|$)"
          },
          {
            "op": "tool",
            "in": [
              "Grep"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "action": [
        {
          "op": "context",
          "message": "[grepai-search-reminder] 提示：检测到你正在使用 grep 类查找工具。必须铭记：代码探索应优先使用 grepai MCP 工具集进行语义搜索，可按意图与语义命中代码，提高搜索精度与token效率。"
        }
      ],
      "owner": "Atlas",
      "blocking": false
    },
    {
      "name": "tscn-tres-guard",
      "on": {
        "in": [
          "PreToolUse"
        ]
      },
      "enabled": true,
      "when": {
        "op": "all",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "tool",
            "in": [
              "Write",
              "Edit"
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "file",
            "patterns": [
              "*.tscn",
              "*.tres"
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "action": [
        {
          "op": "context",
          "message": "[tscn-tres-guard] You are about to Edit a Godot scene/resource file (.tscn/.tres).\nThese files contain fragile reference structures that pure-text replacement can easily break.\n\nMUST check before proceeding:\n  1. UID references (uid=\"uid://...\") — do NOT modify UID values\n  2. ExtResource IDs (id=\"...\" / ExtResource(\"...\")) — ensure all references update together\n  3. Node paths (parent=\"...\", from=\"...\", to=\"...\") — verify paths stay consistent\n  4. Signal connections ([connection signal=...]) — ensure from/to paths are valid\n  5. load_steps count — update if ext_resource/sub_resource count changes\n\nPROHIBITED:\n  - Renaming nodes without updating ALL referencing paths\n  - Deleting [ext_resource]/[sub_resource] without verifying no other line references the ID\n  - Modifying UID values (managed by Godot editor)\n  - Cross-file batch replacement of UIDs or ExtResource IDs\n\nPREFER: Use Godot editor for scene/resource changes. Only Edit pure-text property values.\nSee CLAUDE.md §7 for full .tscn/.tres editing safety guidelines."
        }
      ],
      "owner": "Bachi",
      "blocking": false
    }
  ]
}
